# Locally computed (2026-07-27) -- upstream publishes NO checksums for this
# release: the ip7z/7zip GitHub release for 26.02 carries no checksum assets
# and no hashes in the release body, and 7-zip.org publishes none either
# (re-checked at pin time). BR2_DOWNLOAD_FORCE_CHECK_HASHES=y in the defconfig
# is what makes this file load-bearing rather than decorative.
#
# This is the SAME upstream tarball package/lzma-sdk pins, and the tarball
# sha256 below is therefore identical to the first line of
